# Preserved internal quote calculator

The residential quote calculator at **`/internal/quote-calculator`** is a **permanent archive** of the Sept 2026 Instant Quote + Book flow. Preserve it indefinitely unless the user explicitly asks to replace the archive with a new baseline.

## Do not modify when changing production calculators

When updating live quote flows, apply changes only to production files, for example:

- `src/components/residential/QuoteCalculator.jsx`
- `src/components/ppc/DeepCleanQuoteCalculator.tsx`
- `src/lib/quotePricing.js`
- `src/helpers/calendlyHelpers.js`
- `src/helpers/quoteDraftStorage.ts`
- Header CTA / booking routing tied to the live flow

**Never** edit these for production work:

- `src/components/internal/PreservedQuoteCalculator.jsx`
- `src/components/internal/preserved/**`
- `src/app/internal/quote-calculator/**` (except intentional internal UX like breadcrumbs/footer)

## Isolation rules

- `PreservedQuoteCalculator` must **only** be imported from `/internal/quote-calculator`.
- It uses frozen copies under `src/components/internal/preserved/` (constants, pricing heuristic, Calendly UTM builder, draft storage) — do not wire it back to shared production modules.
- Do not re-export or reuse preserved components on public routes.

## Replacing the archive (rare)

Only when the user explicitly requests a new preserved baseline: copy the then-current production calculator + its dependencies into `PreservedQuoteCalculator.jsx` and `preserved/`, update the header comment date, and keep isolation intact.
